# ===========================================================================
# SmartCA .gitignore (repository-wide)
# ===========================================================================
# frontend/.gitignore additionally covers frontend-specific build output.
# This file covers repo-wide concerns: secrets/env files, Node/Python
# generated artifacts, and local development / AI agent tooling that must
# stay on disk for local use but must never be committed to GitHub.

# --- Environment files / secrets -------------------------------------------
# Never commit real environment files, anywhere in the repo. Example files
# (meant to be committed as templates) are explicitly un-ignored below.
.env
.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- Node ------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.next/

# --- Python (backend/) -------------------------------------------------------
venv/
**/venv/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# --- Local development / AI agent tooling -----------------------------------
# These must remain available on disk for local development but are never
# pushed to GitHub. Do not delete the directories themselves — only keep
# them out of git.

# Claude Code
.claude/
CLAUDE.md

# Serena
.serena/
serena/

# Graphify
graphify-out/
graphify/
.graphify/
